   236	
   237	Our market follows the symmetric baseline design of \citet{smithExperimentalStudyCompetitive1962}. We adopt a symmetric specification deliberately. Since the supply and demand schedules are mirror images, any asymmetry we observe between buyers and sellers can be attributed to model-specific behavior rather than to the market design.
